abstract: >-
  Reproducible depth-motion correction and trace preprocessing for two-photon calcium imaging,
  built on an immutable official Suite2p release with local axial-registration extensions.
keywords:
  - two-photon imaging
  - calcium imaging
  - axial motion correction
  - Suite2p
